      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Meditação. Meditite nunca deixa de praticar ioga diariamente. Ele aumenta sua força interior por meio da meditação, elevando sua energia até conseguir flutuar no ar. Este Pokémon come apenas uma fruta por dia.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Meditite pode evoluir para Medicham no nível 13 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Bide, Work Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Meditate</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Confusion, Detect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Endure</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Feint</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Force Palm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Hidden Power, Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Calm Mind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Mind Reader, Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>High Jump Kick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Acupressure, Psych Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Power Trick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Reversal</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Recover</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Counter</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Attract, Baton Pass, Body Slam, Brick Break, Bulk Up, Calm Mind, Close Combat, Confide, Double Team, Drain Punch, Dream Eater, Endure, Expanding Force, Facade, Fire Punch, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Punch, Frustration, Grass Knot, Gravity, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Imprison, Light Screen, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Magic Coat, Metronome, Night Shade, Pain Split, Poison Jab, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Reversal, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Shadow Ball, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snore, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Punch, Toxic, Trailblaze, Trick, Trick Room, Upper Hand, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Baton Pass, Bullet Punch, Drain Punch, Dynamic Punch, Fake Out, Fire Punch, Foresight, Guard Swap, Ice Punch, Power Swap, Psycho Cut, Quick Guard, Secret Power, Thunder Punch</p>",
